@startuml 04-run-state-machine
!include theme.puml
title AgentRun 首版状态机：Agent Loop、技术等待与中断边界

state ACCEPTED as "ACCEPTED\n已接受"
state STARTING as "STARTING\n准备上下文与工具"
state RUNNING as "RUNNING\nAgent Loop 执行中"
state WAITING_DECISION as "WAITING_DECISION\n等待技术决定"
state WAITING_CHILD as "WAITING_CHILD\n等待单层子 Run"
state CANCELLING as "CANCELLING\n取消中"
state SUCCEEDED as "SUCCEEDED\n成功" LC_SUCCESS
state FAILED as "FAILED\n失败" LC_DANGER
state CANCELLED as "CANCELLED\n已取消" LC_INFRASTRUCTURE
state INTERRUPTED as "INTERRUPTED\n执行中断" LC_DANGER

[*] --> ACCEPTED : start_run\n保存最小 Run + RunAccepted
ACCEPTED --> STARTING : 分配执行预算
STARTING --> RUNNING : ContextFrame 与 ToolSet 就绪
RUNNING --> RUNNING : 模型输出 / 工具结果 / 下一轮上下文
RUNNING --> WAITING_DECISION : 技术 ApprovalRequired
WAITING_DECISION --> RUNNING : decision.submit = 允许
WAITING_DECISION --> CANCELLING : 拒绝 / 超时
RUNNING --> WAITING_CHILD : 创建受限子 AgentRun
WAITING_CHILD --> RUNNING : 子 Run 摘要 / ArtifactRef 返回
RUNNING --> CANCELLING : cancel_run
WAITING_CHILD --> CANCELLING : 父 Run 取消并级联子 Run
CANCELLING --> CANCELLED : 协作取消 / 强制终止完成
CANCELLED --> [*]
RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED : RunCompleted
SUCCEEDED --> [*]
RUNNING --> FAILED : RunFailed
FAILED --> [*]
STARTING --> INTERRUPTED : Sidecar / Adapter 崩溃
RUNNING --> INTERRUPTED : Sidecar / Adapter 崩溃
WAITING_CHILD --> INTERRUPTED : 执行环境失联
INTERRUPTED --> [*]

note right of RUNNING
  首版核心不变量：
  1. tenant_id、deadline 与预算持续生效；
  2. Context / Tool / Delegation 均受有界策略约束；
  3. 规范化事件先追加后发布。
end note
note right of INTERRUPTED
  首版不在同 Run 内自动恢复；
  业务编排如需重试，使用新幂等键启动新 Run，
  并以 retry_of_run_id 关联原 Run。
  Attempt / fence / Checkpoint 保留为后续可选恢复档案。
  约束：UP-AGT-005、UP-DAT-001、UP-RES-001
end note
@enduml
